title: MMC Snap-in Console Execution from Suspicious Path
id: d912ecd4-6cf7-4499-8e62-1fa2cda062fa
status: experimental
description: Detects mmc.exe loading a management console (.msc) from a user-writable or remote path, or mmc spawning a shell, a technique to proxy execution through the trusted Microsoft Management Console.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\mmc.exe'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - '\\Temp\\'
      - '\\AppData\\'
      - '\\Downloads\\'
      - '\\\\'
    CommandLine|contains: '.msc'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Administrators running custom consoles
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.execution
  - attack.t1218
